    "title": "<p><strong>Table&nbsp;9.02</strong>&nbsp;Risk of cancers other than breast and ovarian&nbsp;cancers in <em>BRCA1</em> and <em>BRCA2</em> mutation carriers</p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "",
